mods/scopes-sidebar and mods/scopes-tabs are modified from the `spaces` and
`tabs` mods shipped with herdr-app 0.1.11 (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app). layouts/scopes.json is modified from
its `main` layout. The sidebar merges the spaces and agents lists into one
tree. The tab bar names tabs from the agent's title and allows longer names.

